{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Lasso Livestock!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wrangle Ranch, you\u2019ll have to frantically lasso your farm animals as they dash across the screen, being careful to avoid predators. This uniquely addicting minute-to-minute gameplay is paired with the endless replay-ability and deep strategy of a roguelike deckbuilder to create a first of its kind barn-builder roguelike! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/extras/f1d1e72572dbec1cb73f428f62a44ab6.poster.avif?t=1756654990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/extras/f1d1e72572dbec1cb73f428f62a44ab6.webm?t=1756654990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/extras/f1d1e72572dbec1cb73f428f62a44ab6.mp4?t=1756654990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from the likes of <strong>Fruit Ninja</strong> and <strong>Balatro</strong>, this genre-bending score-a-thon will have you playing just \u2018one more round\u2019 until the cows come home. Explore countless game breaking boons, over a dozen unique animals, and plenty of powerful farmers all for a wallet-friendly price of just $6. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you still aren\u2019t convinced, perhaps the quaint hand drawn pixel art, super catchy bluegrass soundtrack, or the sad pleading eyes of the farm animals will be enough to seal the deal! Lasso your livestock, build your barn, climb the difficulty levels and see how long you can survive in Wrangle Ranch!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974620?t=1756654990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974620?t=1756654990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/fc0ceafeab1ee6b311d898a81c4995437c909da2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756654990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/fc0ceafeab1ee6b311d898a81c4995437c909da2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756654990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Lasso Livestock!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wrangle Ranch, you\u2019ll have to frantically lasso your farm animals as they dash across the screen, being careful to avoid predators. This uniquely addicting minute-to-minute gameplay is paired with the endless replay-ability and deep strategy of a roguelike deckbuilder to create a first of its kind barn-builder roguelike! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/extras/f1d1e72572dbec1cb73f428f62a44ab6.poster.avif?t=1756654990\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/extras/f1d1e72572dbec1cb73f428f62a44ab6.webm?t=1756654990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974620/extras/f1d1e72572dbec1cb73f428f62a44ab6.mp4?t=1756654990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_par